DESCRIPTION:Writing · Berkeley\nhttps://www.meetup.com/kaavya-connections
 -world-poetry-and-literature/events/316448047/\n\nPerhaps home is not sim
 ply the place we come from. Perhaps it is a language in which our name so
 unds different. A kitchen where someone knows what we like to eat. A city
  whose streets our feet remember. A landscape whose seasons still live so
 mewhere in the body. A person beside whom we do not have to explain ourse
 lves. A song that returns us somewhere. Or a place where we arrived as st
 rangers and\,
